{"3470850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Martyrs", "steam_appid": 3470850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessed be and awaken, Novice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have reached Heaven's Gate and your cosmic crusade begins.  Explore the now adrift grand space Basilica to discover the secrets of its silent. Scavenge what resources you can. Hold to your faith, but do not let your will to survive blind you. The mission is all that matters, even if you must stray from the path to complete it. Your sacrifice will be rewarded. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Martyrs is a <strong>grimdark</strong> <strong>survival horror </strong> about a nun in space. Set in an alternate timeline where the 'Church' wins the space race as a propaganda exercise. Inspired by  <strong>Darkwood</strong> and <strong>Signalis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/c9807216073a7251a4bb3d395f7d26fc.poster.avif?t=1786642730\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/c9807216073a7251a4bb3d395f7d26fc.webm?t=1786642730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/c9807216073a7251a4bb3d395f7d26fc.mp4?t=1786642730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover the relics from the martyred Saintly Sisters that came before you,  hold-off the infected, and finish the holy mission. Fear not, Sister, for your martyrdom will be remembered by those that come after you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/6e1998d2c2814ccc96c3d3e827e59290.poster.avif?t=1786642730\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/6e1998d2c2814ccc96c3d3e827e59290.webm?t=1786642730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/6e1998d2c2814ccc96c3d3e827e59290.mp4?t=1786642730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong> <strong>and fight</strong> for scraps amongst whatever lurks in the dark corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> the tools and weapons to help you survive  amongst the silence. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> your faith through different violent or non-violent actions. Your faith will help you navigate the Basilica, and give you access to Saintly or Cursed items and buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure</strong> powerful stigmata and become imbued with divinity. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller or KB+M support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessed be and awaken, Novice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have reached Heaven's Gate and your cosmic crusade begins.  Explore the now adrift grand space Basilica to discover the secrets of its silent. Scavenge what resources you can. Hold to your faith, but do not let your will to survive blind you. The mission is all that matters, even if you must stray from the path to complete it. Your sacrifice will be rewarded. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Martyrs is a <strong>grimdark</strong> <strong>survival horror </strong> about a nun in space. Set in a